---
const title = "余烬防线 · 守住最后一束火光";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="description" content="余烬防线：三路围城、五种防御塔、十五波攻势。无需下载，在浏览器里守护最后的余烬。" />
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#111b1a" />
		<title>{title}</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main id="emberhold">
			<header class="masthead">
				<a class="back" href="/projects/" aria-label="返回项目列表">← <span>返回项目</span></a>
				<div class="wordmark"><span class="sigil">✧</span><div><h1>余烬防线</h1><p>守住最后一束火光</p></div></div>
				<div class="edition"><span class="live-dot"></span> 独立战术塔防 <span class="edition-number">／ 第零一号</span></div>
			</header>
			<section class="command-bar" aria-label="战局状态">
				<div class="resource"><span class="resource-icon gold">◇</span><div><small>可用金币</small><strong id="gold">300</strong></div></div>
				<div class="resource"><span class="resource-icon heart">♡</span><div><small>核心耐久</small><strong><span id="lives">20</span><em> / 20</em></strong></div></div>
				<div class="resource"><span class="resource-icon wave">≋</span><div><small>当前波次</small><strong><span id="wave">00</span><em> / 15</em></strong></div></div>
				<div class="resource score-resource"><span class="resource-icon gold">✧</span><div><small>守望得分</small><strong id="score">0</strong></div></div>
				<div class="toolbar">
					<button id="pause" aria-label="暂停游戏">Ⅱ <span>暂停</span></button>
					<button id="speed" aria-label="切换游戏速度">1×</button>
					<button id="mute" aria-label="切换静音" aria-pressed="false">♪ <span>音效开</span></button>
					<button id="restart" aria-label="重新开始游戏">↻</button>
				</div>
			</section>
			<div class="game-layout">
				<section class="battlefield" aria-label="战场">
					<div class="map-heading"><span><i></i> 灰烬边境 <b>／ 三岔隘口</b></span><span id="phase-label">等待指挥</span></div>
					<div class="canvas-wrap">
						<canvas id="battle-canvas" width="768" height="576" tabindex="0" aria-label="16 列 12 行战场。方向键移动地块，回车选择；右侧选择塔型并建造。">浏览器需要支持画布才能运行游戏。</canvas>
						<div id="overlay" class="overlay">
							<div class="intro-card">
								<div class="overline">三路围城 · 一线生机</div>
								<div class="intro-symbol">✧</div>
								<h2 id="overlay-title">长夜将至<br /><span>余烬不灭。</span></h2>
								<p id="overlay-description">敌军正从雾中逼近。筑起防线，<br />让这座要塞的最后一束火光继续燃烧。</p>
								<div id="instructions" class="instructions"><span><b>01</b> 点击草地，部署防御塔</span><span><b>02</b> 升级火力，守住三条道路</span><span><b>03</b> 撑过十五波，守住余烬核心</span></div>
								<div id="result-stats" class="result-stats" hidden></div>
								<button id="begin" class="primary">点燃烽火 <span>→</span></button>
								<p class="intro-foot" id="overlay-foot">初始 300 金币 · 20 点耐久 · 无需联网</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div id="pause-overlay" class="pause-overlay" hidden><div><span>Ⅱ</span><h2>烽火暂歇</h2><p>战局已暂停，准备好后继续。</p><button id="resume" class="primary">继续防守 →</button></div></div>
					</div>
					<div class="map-footer"><span><i class="legend-road"></i> 敌军路线 <i class="legend-build"></i> 可建造地块 <i class="legend-core"></i> 余烬核心</span><span>16 × 12</span></div>
				</section>
				<aside class="sidebar">
					<section class="panel wave-panel">
						<div class="section-label"><span>攻势情报</span><span id="next-index">01 / 15</span></div>
						<h2 id="wave-name">雾中来客</h2><p class="muted" id="modifier">守住三条进攻路线</p>
						<div id="composition" class="composition"></div>
						<div class="wave-progress"><div id="wave-progress-fill"></div></div>
						<div class="wave-meta"><span id="wave-status">部署你的第一道防线</span><span id="wave-bonus">奖励 +40</span></div>
						<button id="send-wave" class="primary" disabled>开始下一波 <span>→</span></button>
					</section>
					<section class="panel arsenal">
						<div class="section-label"><span>防御工事</span><span>五种战术 · 三级进阶</span></div>
						<div id="tower-palette" class="tower-palette"></div>
						<div class="selection-panel" id="selection-panel">
							<div class="selection-title"><strong id="selection-name">箭塔</strong><span id="selection-level">快速 · 单体</span></div>
							<p id="tower-description">迅捷连射，优先攻击最接近核心的敌人。</p>
							<div class="tower-stats" id="tower-stats"></div>
							<button id="build-tower" class="build-button" disabled>点击地图选择建造位置</button>
							<div id="tower-actions" class="tower-actions" hidden><button id="upgrade" class="build-button">升级</button><button id="sell" class="sell-button">出售</button></div>
						</div>
					</section>
					<div class="field-note"><span>✦ 指挥官手记</span><p id="tip">交汇处部署炮塔与寒冰塔，让密集敌军寸步难行。</p></div>
				</aside>
			</div>
			<div class="dispatch"><span class="dispatch-label">战场通讯</span><p id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">点击空地，建立你的第一座防御塔。</p><span class="kills">击破 <b id="kills">0</b></span></div>
			<footer class="bottom"><span>一簇余烬，也能照亮长夜。</span><div><span>最佳得分 <b id="best-score">0</b></span><span>最佳防守 <b id="best-wave">0</b> 波</span><button id="help">作战指南</button></div></footer>
			<details class="manual" id="manual"><summary>作战指南与敌军图鉴</summary><div class="manual-grid"><section><h3>建造与调度</h3><p>点击草地，选择塔型后确认建造；点击已有塔可升级或出售。出售返还累计投入的 70%。准备阶段可跳过倒计时。金矿仅在战斗中产出，暂停时全部计时冻结。</p><p>方向键移动选中地块，回车选定，空格暂停，数字 1—5 选择塔型，Esc 取消选择。手机上点选地块后，在下方工事面板确认建造。</p></section><section><h3>知己知彼</h3><p>疾行兽速度快，重甲卫血量高；蚀火虫成群出现，祈火者会周期治疗附近敌军。盾焰卫先消耗护盾，狙击塔对护盾造成额外伤害。</p><p>第 5、10、15 波出现领主，漏防扣除 5 点耐久，普通敌人扣除 1 点。第三波起北侧入口加入进攻。后期有急袭、虫潮与铁壁攻势。</p></section><section><h3>守望者的荣誉</h3><p>最终得分 = 守住波数 × 1000 + 击破数 × 10 + 剩余耐久 × 50。最佳得分与完整守住的波数保存在本机。</p><p id="achievements">本局成就：尚未解锁</p></section></div></details>
			<dialog id="restart-dialog"><h2>重新点燃烽火？</h2><p>当前战局将重置，历史最佳纪录会保留。</p><div><button id="cancel-restart">继续本局</button><button id="confirm-restart" class="primary">重新开始</button></div></dialog>
		</main>
		<script>
			import { mount } from "@/lib/emberhold-siege/ui.js";
			mount();
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
<style>
	:global(*){box-sizing:border-box} :global(body){margin:0;background:#101918;color:#e5e2cf;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;font-size:13px} :global(button),:global(a){-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent} :global(button){font:inherit;cursor:pointer} :global(button:disabled){cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.4} :global(button:focus-visible),:global(a:focus-visible),:global(canvas:focus-visible){outline:2px solid #ebbb74;outline-offset:3px} :global([hidden]){display:none!important} :global(button){min-height:42px;color:inherit;background:#ffffff04;border:1px solid #ffffff13;border-radius:5px;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s} :global(button:hover:not(:disabled)){background:#ffffff0c;border-color:#d5b57d70} :global(a){color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
	#emberhold{max-width:1250px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 30px 20px}.masthead{height:110px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #c9c5a014}.back{font-size:12px;color:#99a39a;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.wordmark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.sigil{font-size:48px;color:#e3b878;text-shadow:0 0 24px #edb36b30}.wordmark h1{margin:0;font-family:serif;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:8px;font-weight:600}.wordmark p{color:#959d8d;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:5px;margin:7px 0 0}.edition{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8b968c}.live-dot{display:inline-block;width:5px;height:5px;background:#b9c699;border-radius:50%;margin-right:7px}.edition-number{color:#58665d}.command-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;padding:22px 0}.resource{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center;min-width:110px}.resource-icon{font-size:29px}.gold{color:#ebc478}.heart{color:#d5947f}.wave{color:#b5c2a6}.resource small{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#89978c;margin-bottom:3px}.resource strong{font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:25px;line-height:1.15}.resource em{font-size:12px;font-style:normal;color:#748174}.toolbar{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:7px}.toolbar button{padding:0 12px;min-width:42px;font-size:12px;color:#b8c0b2}.game-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 280px;gap:18px}.battlefield{border:1px solid #73847530;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#182522;align-self:start}.map-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:15px 17px;font-size:11px;color:#b5bfab;letter-spacing:1px;background:#1b2925}.map-heading i{display:inline-block;height:5px;width:5px;background:#e9b471;transform:rotate(45deg);margin-right:8px}.map-heading b{font-weight:400;color:#758578}.map-heading>span:last-child{font-size:10px;color:#b8b291}.canvas-wrap{position:relative;isolation:isolate}canvas{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;touch